<title>UK: Kredietbank unit sets 40 mln Irish pound bond.</title>
<headline>Kredietbank unit sets 40 mln Irish pound bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Kredietbank NV.</p>
<p> BORROWER   KREDIETBANK INTERNATIONAL FINANCE NV</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  KREDIETBANK NV</p>
<p> AMT    40 MLN IEP    COUPON    *5.0	 MATURITY    30.APR.03</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.725   PAY DATE    30.APR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> NOTES     *FOR YEARS ONE TO THREE, 8.0 PCT THEREAFTER</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AA2/AA-   DENOMS (K) 1-5	 SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.625     SELL CONC  1.25	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF THE EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
